WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
Good morning, John.  As you know,

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.080
we only make one Vlogbrothers video a week each,

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.340
and this presents a problem because it makes me feel bad

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.400
every time I make a video that isn't totally epic.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.920
Making a video that's just like

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.280
"here's what's up with me this week"

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.660
It feels like a waste of an opportunity

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.500
to do something important with the platform that I have.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.780
Which has, I think, over the years, kind of changed

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.240
how people perceive the Vlogbrothers channel.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.160
Like if you look at how our videos have

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.360
done over the last couple of months,

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.480
you will see that the ones that are more, like, explain-y,

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.040
well researched, politics videos, those ones do a lot better

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.620
than videos that are more like travel essay or just, like, talk about things,

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.440
and thoughts, that are more traditionally Vlogbrothers-y, at least in my mind.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.900
This is super not a signal for what direction we should be going with the channel,

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:42.660
because, like,

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.820
getting more views is definitely not a path to happiness,

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.980
and also not really a path to success.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:49.760
Things are good here on Vlogbrothers.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.280
We got a lot of stuff going on in our lives.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.500
We don't need views.  Like, that's not what we're doing here.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.740
But it's hard not to kinda take it as guidance,

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.000
'cause it's like, okay, people like this, we should make more of this.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.280
I say, "No.  We should not."

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.800
We have to mix it up, because that's what makes this channel interesting,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.280
not just for people watching, but also for me.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.120
But it's harder to mix it up when we have fewer opportunities to mix it up because

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:12.760
we only make one video a week, but we HAVE to only make one video a week because... lots of good reasons.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.600
The primary reason being that this community has given us opportunities to do really important,

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.280
wonderful things that we believe in.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.540
Like, I want to make "Wizard School" a really amazing game.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.860
I want to make VidCon a really amazing conference.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:27.540
I want to encourage a new generation of video creators, and SciShow, and Crash Course

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.320
have become huge and I want them to be  bigger and better.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.580
But as SciShow and Crash Course are now, amazingly,

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.020
bigger than Vlogbrothers, both in views and subscribers,

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:41.720
you might be tempted to think that SciShow and Crash Course have become more important in my life personally

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.640
than Vlogbrothers, which is not even close to the case.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:48.580
This channel is still by far, to me, the most interesting thing that I have ever done,

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:52.180
that I am currently doing, probably that I will ever do in my whole life.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.400
All of you who watch, whether this is your first episode,

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:58.440
or you've seen them all, whether you're an occasional viewer, or an every episode viewer,

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:02.540
having a group of people that relies on me to always  have a good idea every week,

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:09.180
and that I can't imagine ever letting down, you are such a vital part of the amazing life that I am having.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:13.540
I cannot imagine having done any of amazing things that I've done in the last 10 years,

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.760
without this obligation that I have to Nerdfighteria, to this community.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.000
But, this channel has changed many times over the years.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.060
It will continue to change.  As our profiles have been elevated for lots of different reasons,

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.140
it's felt less safe to be as open.  And so we're more guarded now.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.860
That also might be a symptom of the YouTube platform maturing,

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:33.120
and of, like, us maturing- we're 10 years older now.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.480
And because of that I feel a little less desire to be silly.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.160
Like, if you go watch older videos, there's a lot more silliness.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.560
And likewise, my music has been on the back-burner for so long that lots of people don't even know that I write music.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.420
Or that I never would have without this channel.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.080
Luckily I now have SnapChat for the more silly stuff.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:49.480
We've got almost a year now of the Dear Hank and John podcast,

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.580
which is a great opportunity for more conversational brotherly connection,

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.620
and I still get to go on tour with the Perfect Strangers,

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.780
which we'll doing in about a week,

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:59.160
which is just one of my very favorite things to do in the entire world.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.500
Just playin' music for nerds.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.600
Sometimes I am sad things must change,

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:06.340
and I am sad things cannot be the way that I would want them to be in a perfect world.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.380
But I also love to see how things have changed over the years,

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.760
and I kinda can't wait to see where it's all headed.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:19.520
I hope that I never let you down, Nerdfighteria. I spend a lot of my time thinking about how to do the things that you would want me to do.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.760
And I hope it's going okay.  John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.200
If you want to hear about some of the stuff I'm up to personally,

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:28.180
that means that I can't maybe make all the Vlogbrothers videos I want to,

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:34.560
but that I care a lot about and I think are really cool, I put another video up on HanksChannel where I just talk about things that are going on right now.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.340
If you want to watch that, frankly, I would be honored.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:38.360
That's all.  Have a lovely day.

